{"unit_id":"MukiyoU__dsh-music-analyze#card-card-zh","repo":"MukiyoU/dsh-music-analyze","commit":"07792b7792ade95315f68cad33e8d7ab5ff303ea","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-music-analyze 是一个面向 DSH 的音乐分析工具：输入音频或视频文件，可选指定起止时间、图表输出目录和标题。插件调用 Python 分析脚本，将音频转换为 22050Hz 单声道，再生成波形、梅尔频谱、色度和逐秒能量四联图，并输出时长、BPM、主调、频段能量比例及响度较高和较低的时刻。BPM 由多个估计方法交叉判断并附带候选依据。适合希望用图表和指标讨论音乐特征的用户；需要 Python 分析依赖和 ffmpeg，不需要 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:145-170","index.js:207-240","python/music_analyze.py:245-267","python/music_analyze.py:270-426"]}
{"unit_id":"MukiyoU__dsh-music-analyze#card-card-en","repo":"MukiyoU/dsh-music-analyze","commit":"07792b7792ade95315f68cad33e8d7ab5ff303ea","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-music-analyze turns audio or video into waveform, spectrogram, chroma, and energy charts. It reports duration, BPM, key, frequency energy, and loud or quiet moments. Users can select a time range. Python analysis packages and ffmpeg are required; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:145-170","index.js:207-240","python/music_analyze.py:245-267","python/music_analyze.py:270-426"]}
